{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715870/extras/aa90a5dd65d2b40ef6a8778dcd94cb49.webp?t=1768320559\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715870/extras/aa90a5dd65d2b40ef6a8778dcd94cb49.poster.webp?t=1768320559\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=180 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is old and unwell. An ominous affliction has left every living soul weak, terrified and helpless before despair. But this paralyzing infestation has left the innocence of a young child untainted. Lost in limbo, an otherworldly journey awaits you. Find answers. Face your greatest fear. Confront reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715870/extras/aa3fba2ddacd50f791efbd8426fae5fd.webp?t=1768320559\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715870/extras/aa3fba2ddacd50f791efbd8426fae5fd.poster.webp?t=1768320559\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=180 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BEFORE I GO depicts a contemplative reflection on existence and the transitory nature of life. Lose yourself in this enigmatic tale. In adversity, find your way to deliverance and peace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715870/extras/c39235d5b6b2cfa919ec48c966921b95.webp?t=1768320559\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715870/extras/c39235d5b6b2cfa919ec48c966921b95.poster.webp?t=1768320559\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=180 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BEFORE I GO is a challenging side-scrolling action-platformer that distils the classic genre to its most beloved aspects, fulfilling old-school platformer lovers as well as fresh mechanics enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715870/extras/b04cf63c0359757cc0aa30a6120b4dc3.webp?t=1768320559\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715870/extras/b04cf63c0359757cc0aa30a6120b4dc3.poster.webp?t=1768320559\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=180 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unconventional story telling grounded in a genuine emotional tragedy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique art style with a foreboding and melancholic atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a non-linear elaborate world, immerse yourself in a dreamlike universe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome meticulously crafted and intense platforming sections.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Withstand unforgiving parasitic abominations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assimilate powerful and dexterous abilities, sharpen your skills, perfect the promptness of your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master intuitive, responsive, and diligently tuned controls.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2715870?t=1768320559","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768320559","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715870/716f53dc5c332ae121e9dc55c304074aaff15b0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768320559","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715870/716f53dc5c332ae121e9dc55c304074aaff15b0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768320559","ca