\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715870/extras/c39235d5b6b2cfa919ec48c966921b95.poster.webp?t=1768320559\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=180 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BEFORE I GO is a challenging side-scrolling action-platformer that distils the classic genre to its most beloved aspects, fulfilling old-school platformer lovers as well as fresh mechanics enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715870/extras/b04cf63c0359757cc0aa30a6120b4dc3.webp?t=1768320559\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715870/extras/b04cf63c0359757cc0aa30a6120b4dc3.poster.webp?t=1768320559\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=180 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unconventional story telling grounded in a genuine emotional tragedy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique art style with a foreboding and melancholic atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a non-linear elaborate world, immerse yourself in a dreamlike universe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome meticulously crafted and intense platforming sections.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Withstand unforgiving parasitic abominations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assimilate powerful and dexterous abilities, sharpen your skills, perfect the promptness of your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master intuitive, responsive, and diligently tuned controls.</p></li></ul>","developers":["J's Labratory"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as